      "block_id": "BL-6137-2.4.06-13",
      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "A good conclusion answers the selected criterion under the supplied conditions. If the objective is avoiding on-site combustion during daylight generation, solar can meet that narrow aim where suitable. If the objective is dependable all-hour service, the wider system must be demonstrated. If the objective is affordability, complete comparable costs are needed. Such bounded judgements remain useful while recognising that every source has practical requirements.",
      "claim_ids": [
