    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-2.4.06-14",
      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "Power and energy adequacy need checking separately. A storage device may contain enough energy for several hours but lack the discharge power required to run a large load at once.",
