    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-2.4.06-15",
      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "A simple load example uses a two-kilowatt appliance for three hours, requiring six kilowatt-hours. A store able to deliver only four kilowatt-hours cannot supply the full interval without another source, even if it can provide two kilowatts initially.",
