      "block_id": "BL-6137-2.4.06-17",
      "block_type": "worked_application",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "Operational flexibility also varies between technologies and designs. Some generators can change output more readily than others, while minimum operating levels, start-up times and maintenance affect practical decisions. A system plan connects resource availability, demand timing and the usable characteristics of each component.",
